NAME: a three-point imp ring in RED
DESCRIPTION: three processes reach imp, imp+step and imp+2*step in order (step 2667, an EQU; jumps through label arithmetic); phase-2 archetype suite (i-7d2612-34b61d), see behtests/archetype_impring.beh
SRC:
(program
  (const step 2667)
  (seq
    (SPL (Dir 2))
    (SPL (Dir 1))
    (JMP (Dec vec))
    (JMP (+ imp (* 2 step)))
    (JMP (+ imp step))
    (JMP imp)
    (label vec)
    (DAT 0 0)
    (label imp)
    (MOV I (# 0) (Dir step))))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b
step EQU 2667

  SPL    $2     , #0     
  SPL    $1     , #0     
  JMP    <vec   , #0     
  JMP    $imp+(2*step), #0     
  JMP    $imp+step, #0     
  JMP    $imp   , #0     
vec   
  DAT    #0     , #0     
imp   
  MOV.I  #0     , $step  
  DAT    $0     , $0     